      "t": "Tax inspector Colette Brancillon arrives at the agency. Andrea has arranged for an ex-boyfriend to replace her, but the inspector looks familiar and Andrea suddenly thinks she can manage. You will hear Andrea and Colette, with Gabriel relaying the other partners' brief comments in this shortened French retelling.",
